# Android Studio's "Generate Signed App Bundle" wizard writes here. It takes its keystore from
# its own dialog rather than the signingConfig in app/build.gradle.kts, so a bundle produced this
# way can be signed with the wrong key while the Gradle setup looks correct — which is exactly
# what Play rejected once. Use `./gradlew bundleRelease` and upload from
# app/build/outputs/bundle/release/ instead.
app/release/
